window.docContents[110].resolve({"/3___-General-results-of-representation-theory/3___7___-The-Jordan-Holder-theorem/Section-3___7___-The-Jordan-Holder-theorem-___-heading-and-overview/#Chapter3___Introduction_to_3___7___heading-1":{"contents":"We will now state and prove two important theorems about representations of finite dimensional algebras — the Jordan-Holder theorem and the Krull-Schmidt theorem.\n\n\n","context":"Introduction to Representation Theory\t3. General results of representation theory\t3.7. The Jordan-Holder theorem\tSection 3.7: The Jordan-Holder theorem — heading and overview","header":"3.7. The Jordan-Holder theorem","id":"/3___-General-results-of-representation-theory/3___7___-The-Jordan-Holder-theorem/Section-3___7___-The-Jordan-Holder-theorem-___-heading-and-overview/#Chapter3___Introduction_to_3___7___heading-1"},"/8___-Homological-algebra/8___1___-Projective-and-injective-modules/Introduction-to-injective-modules/#Chapter8___Discussion_after_Exercise8___1___4":{"contents":"There is also a notion of an injective module, which is dual to the notion of a projective module. Namely, we have the following theorem.\n\nLet A be an algebra and let I be a left A-module.\n\n\n\n","context":"Introduction to Representation Theory\t8. Homological algebra\t8.1. Projective and injective modules\tIntroduction to injective modules","header":"Introduction to injective modules","id":"/8___-Homological-algebra/8___1___-Projective-and-injective-modules/Introduction-to-injective-modules/#Chapter8___Discussion_after_Exercise8___1___4"},"/9___-Structure-of-finite-dimensional-algebras/Chapter-9___-Structure-of-finite-dimensional-algebras/#Chapter9___Introduction___heading-1":{"contents":"In this chapter we return to studying the structure of finite dimensional algebras. Throughout the chapter, we work over an algebraically closed field k (of any characteristic).\n\n\n","context":"Introduction to Representation Theory\t9. Structure of finite dimensional algebras\tChapter 9: Structure of finite dimensional algebras","header":"Chapter 9. Structure of finite dimensional algebras","id":"/9___-Structure-of-finite-dimensional-algebras/Chapter-9___-Structure-of-finite-dimensional-algebras/#Chapter9___Introduction___heading-1"}});
